    "ModifyFiles",
    "ModifyCssFiles",
    "GenerateFiles"
  ],
  "Description": "The Start goal listens for changes in specific file types and executes corresponding actions. It listens for changes in all '*.html' files while excluding 'header.html' and 'footer.html', and calls the !ModifyFiles function. It also listens for changes in 'style.css' and calls !ModifyCssFiles. Additionally, it listens for changes in all text files located in the '/content/' directory and calls !GenerateHtmlFiles. After that, it retrieves the paths of all '*.html' files and stores them in the variable \\%filePaths\\%. Finally, it iterates over each path in \\%filePaths\\% and calls !ModifyFiles with the current item's full path as a parameter.",
